# @name logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/logout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authToken}}


###
# @name uploadProfilePicture
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile-pic
Accept: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: image/png; boundary=boundary
Cookie: {{authToken}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="picture"; filename="profile-pic.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:/Users/danie/OneDrive/Pictures/679e6d62-2824-424a-c61a-62e23de86f7a.png
--boundary--


